## Relationships

### Parent Objective(s)

None.

SO-F-001 is the root Functional Objective and is not derived from any other Functional Objective.

---

### Child Objective(s)

Child objectives shall be derived from SO-F-001 as the Functional Objective library evolves.

The initial planned child objectives include:

| Identifier | Title | Relationship |
|------------|-------|--------------|
| SO-F-002 | Perceive the Operating Environment | Direct Child |
| SO-F-003 | Interpret the Operating Context | Direct Child |
| SO-F-004 | Generate Adaptive Decisions | Direct Child |
| SO-F-005 | Execute Approved Actions | Direct Child |

---

### Supporting Objective(s)

None at this stage.

Supporting relationships will be established as additional engineering domains are developed.

---

### Dependent Objective(s)

All Functional Objectives derived from SO-F-001 depend upon the successful realization of this objective.

---

### Related Objective(s)

Relationships with Coordination, Safety, Performance, Reliability, and other objective categories shall be established as those categories are introduced.

---

### Relationship Notes

SO-F-001 serves as the root node of the Functional Objective hierarchy.

Engineering changes affecting this objective shall be evaluated for impact across all descendant objectives before approval.
